<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-TONGA BEAT BORDER 27-10.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-TONGA BEAT BORDER 27-10.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tonga beat Border 27-10 (halftime 17-0) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Border - Try: David Maidza. Conversion: Greg Miller. Penalty: Miller.</p>
<p>Tonga - Tries: Chris Schumkel (2), Kilioni Tu'ipulotu. Conversions: Gustavo Tonga (3). Penalties: Tonga (2).</p>
</text>
